.ai-task-manager/project-fields.json
.ai-task-manager/project-field-events.json
# All machine-local/transient runtime state now lives under .tmp/aitm/ (#573),
# already ignored wholesale via the `.tmp/` rule above: state, queue, fleet,
# cache, orchestrator.lock, locks/, sessions/, gates/, and per-app (app/claude,
# app/codex) trees. No per-file rules needed here.
